Sugriva offers crown and umbrella back to Vali --- Sugriva pleads ministers forced the crowning --- Vali denounces him before kinsmen and ministers --- Vali claims Sugriva sealed him inside for the throne --- Vali exiles Sugriva in a single garment --- Sugriva roams the earth wifeless to Rishyamuka --- Sugriva begs grace against world-feared Vali --- Rama vows sunlike shafts will fell wicked Vali
